  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 1004.03 Application Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 1004.03 Application Requirements. An eligible applicant, as specified in Env-Hw 1004.02, seeking HWCF monies for a household DIY used oil collection center shall:\n\n(a) Complete and submit Form HWM-9 “Household Do-It-Yourself (DIY) Used Oil Collection Center Grant Application” as amended February 2026; and\n\n(b) If the applicant is required to register with the New Hampshire secretary of state, submit a current certificate of good standing.\n\nSource. #14284, eff 8-1-25; ss by #14528, eff 2-28-26, EXPIRES: 2-28-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw1000.html"
}
